      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dominant intramolecular NiII–GdIII ferromagnetic coupling. χmT = 69.10 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K (theory 71.04), rising to 172.22 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization 53.36 NμB at 2 K and 7 T (below saturation 88.23 NμB). Slow magnetic relaxation under zero dc field with χm″ maxima between 15 K (999 Hz) and 13.8 K (10 Hz); Orbach fit Ueff = 818.8 K, τ0 = 1.88×10−27 s. Magnetocaloric −ΔSm = 19.24 J kg−1 K−1 at 4.0 K and 7 T.",
